  "description": "High-performance, allocation-free archetype Entity Component System (ECS) for C# and long-running .NET 10 servers: game servers, simulations, real-time backends. Faster than Friflo.Engine.ECS, Arch and DefaultEcs on a full server tick, with zero allocation per tick. Source-generated [ForEach] systems, immediate structural changes, safe parallel systems, change tracking, value indexes, relations, dynamic buffers, snapshots and saves; a Roslyn analyzer with code fixes. Native AOT ready.",
